    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/software-cms/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Software CMS is a modern, professional, and highly customizable theme designed for businesses, startups, and agencies in the software, technology, and IT sectors. Perfect for software companies, SaaS platforms, app developers, IT solutions providers, software development firms, tech startups, digital agencies, cloud services, and enterprise software businesses, this theme provides an effective platform to showcase products, services, and technological solutions. With a clean, responsive, and mobile-friendly layout, it ensures a seamless user experience across desktops, tablets, and smartphones. Key features include customizable sections for product demos, service highlights, case studies, client testimonials, banners with Call to Action (CTA) buttons, and integrated blog areas to share updates and insights. Software CMS also includes advanced personalization options for layouts, colors, fonts, and sections, allowing businesses to maintain a unique brand identity. Fully compatible with Contact Form 7 for client inquiries, WooCommerce for software or digital product sales, and Spectra for enhanced block layouts and content presentation, this theme offers a complete, user-friendly, and professional solution to establish a strong online presence for software and technology ventures. Demo: https://preview.wpradiant.net/software-cms/"
    },
